{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2006_CyMO-11.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/d/d0/2006_CyMO-11.PNG/250px-2006_CyMO-11.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"203\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/d/d0/2006_CyMO-11.PNG/375px-2006_CyMO-11.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/d/d0/2006_CyMO-11.PNG/500px-2006_CyMO-11.PNG 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf085a9f8c8f5f7887608d54db8a321f0d121909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\epsilon):x-2y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/d/7ad413812bf2a4a0e1ec1761a3accdb153b29659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\delta):x+y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" /> intersect at the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" />. If the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/5/7951a556866615669d4304f02b69afaa0cd2b881.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\delta)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> intersects the axes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/7/8d736e23f7d0d28d84a440e563d4698e742f8b47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Ox$\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/72882d5db5487c7f3d237766f51d96bd5e6906b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Oy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"16\" /> to the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> respectively, then the ratio of the area of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/6/d96442b05d8a9b0d7d843cf88d9df83b60624b6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OA\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> to the area of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/8/3c81893079f1c15d9b067f73689ff4add4f86e73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OB\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/0/4907310c3df5e74e755262f09be55fcafa31dc95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{3}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac{4}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"361\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We find some coordinates:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/e/94e1baf8d541d0a7887587d42b5175432b680eb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O=(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684ae14cd61805f7f1a18138010f7940a81d0077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=(4,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/7/d675c5676aafcb81f44f31a544ef39a6576e413e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=(0,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/c/62c46d2569e2707cfb7105427c3b001930740d17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma =\\left(\\frac{8}{3},\\frac{4}{3}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"92\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>We find the area of triangles:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adc725ea15c033d507efaff92d9aaa5d05fb2021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[OAB]=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/e/9de3ae98aa4e1561975ed2f9e1037ad34d2bf398.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[OA\\Gamma]=\\frac{\\frac{4}{3}*4}{2}=\\frac{8}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/d/1cd74717074ad0368af9534e61a7da9f662f4c85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[OB\\Gamma]=[OAB]-[OA\\Gamma]=\\frac{16}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"244\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30ecfd35a99fd407b740289a65cb5970efb127c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{[OA\\Gamma]}{[OB\\Gamma]}=\\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm {(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"146\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_M